Following [[9](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2607.01203v1#bib.bib9)] and [[10](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2607.01203v1#bib.bib10)], this formulation preserves dual consistency and yields an equivalent reformulation of the RNOCP under the proposed decomposition.
